{"en": "1439072261", "title": "Admin : Configurer les notifications d'analyses", "adf": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Guide pratique · Administrateurs", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "En bref"}]}, {"type": "table", "attrs": {"layout": "default", "width": 760.0}, "content": [{"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Objectif"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Choisir les notifications envoyées pour chaque analyse : au patient ou au prescripteur, par e-mail ou par SMS."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Résultat obtenu"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Des canaux de notification activés pour chaque analyse, afin que les résultats et les mises à jour parviennent automatiquement aux bonnes personnes."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Qui s'en charge"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Administrateurs. L'accès dépend des droits de l'utilisateur et peut être configuré par votre administrateur."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Avant de commencer"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Savoir quelles analyses doivent déclencher quelles notifications. L'envoi des e-mails et des SMS doit être configuré (voir Propriétés de l'application)."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Où"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Menu principal → Administration → Configuration des notifications de test."}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "La configuration des notifications de test est une grille qui présente, pour chaque analyse, les quatre canaux de notification : E-mail du patient, SMS du patient, E-mail du prestataire et SMS du prestataire. Cochez les canaux qu'une analyse doit utiliser ; ouvrez Modifier pour une analyse afin de définir ses modèles de message"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Étape 1 : Rechercher l'analyse"}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Ouvrez le "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Main Menu ", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "(menu principal) puis"}, {"type": "text", "text": " Administration.", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "center", "width": 760, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 951, "alt": "Admin August.png", "id": "3b77b1d6-e154-4f7d-b66c-b26cd0dd392d", "collection": "contentId-1439072261", "type": "file", "height": 371}}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cliquer sur Administration", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 2}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cliquez sur"}, {"type": "text", "text": " Configuration des notifications de test", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Test Notification Configuration", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ")."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "center", "width": 760, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 957, "alt": "test not.png", "id": "8ef9ee8f-e5cf-48f4-8d7d-e5246d8078c4", "collection": "contentId-1439072261", "type": "file", "height": 384}}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Configuration des notifications de test", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "panel", "attrs": {"panelType": "info"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "La grille liste chaque analyse avec une case à cocher par canal. Filtrez avec "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Noms des tests", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Test names", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") ou "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Sélectionnez le type d'échantillon", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Select sample type", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") pour affiner la liste (utilisez "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Effacer les filtres", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Clear Filters", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") pour réinitialiser)."}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "align-start", "width": 1020, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 2894, "id": "133e75b3-4bdd-447a-a3f1-45402c902bca", "collection": "contentId-1439072261", "type": "file", "height": 5084}}, {"type": "caption",